data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:43:40.864676+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_708674719c064adc", "event_type": "blueprint.delegation.completed", "session_id": "sess_be7e4295c87a", "workspace_id": "ws_9f03590dd4d4", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_0d94515cedad", "turn_id": "msg_user_0d94515cedad", "span_id": "sem_708674719c064adc", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "ndp_dataset_discovery returned a compact result to data.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:43:40.856182+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "ndp_dataset_discovery", "role": "child_expert"}, "subject": {"agent_id": "data", "role": "parent_expert"}, "blueprint": {"pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": "data", "child_expert": "ndp_dataset_discovery"}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"delegate_to": "ndp_dataset_discovery", "agent_id": "ndp_dataset_discovery", "question": "Search the NDP catalog for EarthScope GNSS station-metadata resources covering the Los Angeles region (center: 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, within 100 km radius). Discover and stage the EarthScope station-metadata CSV that lists available stations for spatial filtering and ranking. Return the staged metadata path (acquisition.metadata_path) for downstream station catalog filtering.", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "data", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "data", "return_payload": "compact_result", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 52539, "execution_mode": "blueprint_react", "input": "Search the NDP catalog for EarthScope GNSS station-metadata resources covering the Los Angeles region (center: 34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W, within 100 km radius). Discover and stage the EarthScope station-metadata CSV that lists available stations for spatial filtering and ranking. Return the staged metadata path (acquisition.metadata_path) for downstream station catalog filtering.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n(To be populated after all data-branch children complete their work and evidence is merged.)\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"provenance\": \"osm_nominatim\", \"radius_km\": 100, \"region_name\": \"Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\", \"status\": \"resolved\", \"warnings\": [\"Search radius of 100 km assumed as default for regional GNSS and seismic analysis; not specified in request\"]}, \"pipeline\": [\"geospatial\", \"data\", \"analysis\", \"visualization\", \"synthesis\"], \"request\": \"Explore recent seismic activity around Los Angeles with EarthScope GNSS context and artifact\", \"status\": \"data_discovery_in_progress\"}}", "output_summary": "EarthScope station metadata catalog successfully discovered and staged in workspace. The cleaned catalog (with misaligned header resolved) is available at:\n\n**Cleaned Metadata Path**: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`\n\n**Source URL**: `https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv`\n\n**Dataset**: EarthScope Stations Dataset (earthscope_stations)\n\nThe catalog contains one row per GNSS station with station id and coordinate columns. The file has been cleaned to remove header ambiguity and is ready for spatial filtering to the Los Angeles 100 km radius region.", "return_output_summary": "EarthScope station metadata catalog successfully discovered and staged in workspace. The cleaned catalog (with misaligned header resolved) is available at:\n\n**Cleaned Metadata Path**: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`\n\n**Source URL**: `https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv`\n\n**Dataset**: EarthScope Stations Dataset (earthscope_stations)\n\nThe catalog contains one row per GNSS station with station id and coordinate columns. The file has been cleaned to remove header ambiguity and is ready for spatial filtering to the Los Angeles 100 km radius region.", "local_output_summary": "EarthScope station metadata catalog successfully discovered and staged in workspace. The cleaned catalog (with misaligned header resolved) is available at:\n\n**Cleaned Metadata Path**: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`\n\n**Source URL**: `https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv`\n\n**Dataset**: EarthScope Stations Dataset (earthscope_stations)\n\nThe catalog contains one row per GNSS station with station id and coordinate columns. The file has been cleaned to remove header ambiguity and is ready for spatial filtering to the Los Angeles 100 km radius region.", "workflow_state": {"geospatial": {"bbox": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], "center_lat": 34.0536909, "center_lon": -118.242766, "confidence": "high", "provenance": "osm_nominatim", "radius_km": 100, "region_name": "Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States", "status": "resolved", "warnings": ["Search radius of 100 km assumed as default for regional GNSS and seismic analysis; not specified in request"]}, "pipeline": ["geospatial", "data", "analysis", "visualization", "synthesis"], "request": "Explore recent seismic activity around Los Angeles with EarthScope GNSS context and artifact", "status": "data_discovery_in_progress", "catalog": {"status": "metadata_found"}, "acquisition": {"status": "metadata_only", "metadata_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "analysis_ready": false}}, "local_workflow_state": {"catalog": {"status": "metadata_found"}, "acquisition": {"status": "metadata_only", "metadata_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "analysis_ready": false}}, "tools_called": [{"name": "ndp_search_datasets", "args": {"search_terms": ["earthscope", "converted"], "limit": 10}, "ok": true, "telemetry_source": "agent_trajectory", "result": "{\"datasets\": [{\"id\": \"811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41\", \"name\": \"earthscope_stations\", \"title\": \"EarthScope Stations Dataset\", \"owner_org\": null, \"notes\": \"The EarthScope Consortium streams three-dimensional GNSS high rate (1Hz) position time series from nearly a thousand GNSS stations to study earthquakes, volcanos, tsunamis, hydrologic loads, and glaciers. The data is made available via the National Data Platform pilot project.\\n[touch 2025-10-29 15:44:20]\", \"resource