egion.", "return_output_summary": "EarthScope station metadata catalog successfully discovered and staged in workspace. The cleaned catalog (with misaligned header resolved) is available at:\n\n**Cleaned Metadata Path**: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`\n\n**Source URL**: `https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv`\n\n**Dataset**: EarthScope Stations Dataset (earthscope_stations)\n\nThe catalog contains one row per GNSS station with station id and coordinate columns. The file has been cleaned to remove header ambiguity and is ready for spatial filtering to the Los Angeles 100 km radius region.", "workflow_state": {"geospatial": {"bbox": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], "center_lat": 34.0536909, "center_lon": -118.242766, "confidence": "high", "provenance": "osm_nominatim", "radius_km": 100, "region_name": "Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States", "status": "resolved", "warnings": ["Search radius of 100 km assumed as default for regional GNSS and seismic analysis; not specified in request"]}, "pipeline": ["geospatial", "data", "analysis", "visualization", "synthesis"], "request": "Explore recent seismic activity around Los Angeles with EarthScope GNSS context and artifact", "status": "data_discovery_in_progress", "catalog": {"status": "metadata_found"}, "acquisition": {"status": "metadata_only", "metadata_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "analysis_ready": false}}}}}

