data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:43:57.968160+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_18897b10765a49a7", "event_type": "expert.response.completed", "session_id": "sess_be7e4295c87a", "workspace_id": "ws_9f03590dd4d4", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_0d94515cedad", "turn_id": "msg_user_0d94515cedad", "span_id": "sem_18897b10765a49a7", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "Expert data produced a response.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:43:57.964884+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "data"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {"agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": "main"}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"selected_expert": "data", "route_source": "agent_blueprint", "route_reason": "Session selected Agent Blueprint expert 'data'.", "answer": "(To be populated after all downstream experts complete their work.)", "expert_handoffs": [], "tools_called": [], "file_diffs": [], "error_info": null, "reasoning": "The data acquisition expert has received the completed result from `ndp_dataset_discovery`, which successfully staged the cleaned EarthScope station metadata catalog at `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`.\n\nCurrent state:\n- \u2713 Geospatial resolution: complete (Los Angeles, 100 km radius)\n- \u2713 Metadata discovery: complete (cleaned catalog staged)\n- \u23f3 Station ranking: NOT YET STARTED\n- \u23f3 Station time-series staging: NOT YET STARTED\n\nThe workflow_state now contains `acquisition.metadata_path`, which is the exact prerequisite for the next step. According to the handoff chain and routing rules, the next expert must be `earthscope_station_catalog`, which will:\n1. Spatially filter the staged metadata catalog to the Los Angeles 100 km radius\n2. Rank nearby GNSS stations by spatial relevance and completeness\n3. Return a ranked list of station candidates\n\nOnly after station ranking is complete can `ndp_resource_resolver` stage the selected station's time-series CSV for analysis."}}}

