data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:44:32.813299+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_67e85987b2a848f2", "event_type": "react.step.completed", "session_id": "sess_be7e4295c87a", "workspace_id": "ws_9f03590dd4d4", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_0d94515cedad", "turn_id": "msg_user_0d94515cedad", "span_id": "sem_67e85987b2a848f2", "parent_span_id": "24b3500b4cfa4f48", "status": "completed", "summary": "earthscope_station_catalog ReAct step 2: finish", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:44:32.808799+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "earthscope_station_catalog", "role": "expert"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {}, "provider": {}, "payload": {"expert_id": "earthscope_station_catalog", "expert_span_id": "24b3500b4cfa4f48", "step_span_id": "988adbd53a6d480d", "step_index": 2, "thought": "Excellent! The geo_filter_points_by_radius tool succeeded with outstanding results:\n- **within_radius_count**: 155 stations within the 100 km radius\n- **skipped_invalid**: 0 (all rows parsed correctly)\n- **points**: 155 within-radius stations, sorted by distance ascending\n\nThis is exceptional EarthScope GNSS coverage for the Los Angeles region! The closest stations are:\n1. MTA1 (0.3 km) - almost at the center!\n2. PKRD (2.2 km)\n3. ELSC (4.1 km)\n4. USC2 (5.0 km)\n5. SILK (5.8 km)\n\nAnd 150 more stations extending up to 99.7 km away.\n\nAccording to the instructions, I should emit:\n- `station_catalog.status=ranked` (since within_radius_count >= 1)\n- `station_catalog.station_ids` as a flat list of all 155 station IDs\n- `resource_discovery.station_resource_queries` with preferred NDP search calls for top candidates\n- The parent `data` orchestrator will advance to `ndp_resource_resolver` to stage the selected stations\n\nNow I'll construct the final workflow_state and call finish.", "reasoning": "", "tool_name": "finish", "tool_args": {}, "observation": "Completed.", "is_finish": true}}}

