data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:45:29.643698+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_cb4774e9e3c44844", "event_type": "react.step.completed", "session_id": "sess_be7e4295c87a", "workspace_id": "ws_9f03590dd4d4", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_0d94515cedad", "turn_id": "msg_user_0d94515cedad", "span_id": "sem_cb4774e9e3c44844", "parent_span_id": "b6833021bb874399", "status": "completed", "summary": "ndp_resource_resolver ReAct step 0: ndp_search_datasets", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:45:29.634938+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "ndp_resource_resolver", "role": "expert"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {}, "provider": {}, "payload": {"expert_id": "ndp_resource_resolver", "expert_span_id": "b6833021bb874399", "step_span_id": "47bf6cc0ca3549f0", "step_index": 0, "thought": "I need to stage GNSS time-series CSV data for the ranked EarthScope stations in Los Angeles. The request asks for at least one station's analysis-ready time-series CSV (with time, east, north, up columns).\n\nCurrent state:\n- 155 ranked stations with MTA1 being closest at 0.3 km\n- `acquisition.status` = \"metadata_only\" (not yet staged)\n- I must CALL the tools to actually stage the CSV, not just describe what I would do\n\nMy plan:\n1. Search for MTA1's datasets using `ndp_search_datasets` with `dataset_title=\"MTA1\"`\n2. Find the time-series CSV resource (e.g., `MTA1.*.csv`)\n3. Stage it using `ndp_stage_resource` with the CSV URL and `max_bytes=60000000`\n4. Record the staged path, set acquisition status to staged, and mark analysis_ready=true\n5. If MTA1 fails, move to PKRD, ELSC, etc.\n\nLet me start by searching for MTA1's datasets.", "reasoning": "", "tool_name": "ndp_search_datasets", "tool_args": {"dataset_title": "MTA1", "limit": 20}, "observation": "{\"datasets\": [{\"id\": \"1b0c1b93-f164-4025-bd7b-000252b5ca18\", \"name\": \"mta1-ci-ly-30\", \"title\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30\", \"owner_org\": \"earthscope_consortium\", \"notes\": \"The EarthScope Consortium streams three-dimensional GNSS high rate (1 Hz) position time series from nearly a thousand GNSS stations to study earthquakes, volcanoes, tsunamis, hydrologic loads, and glaciers. The data is made available via the National Data Platform pilot project.\", \"resources\": [{\"id\": \"2ec8d2ee-2c3a-451c-8515-4e109e911737\", \"url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"name\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"description\": \"EarthScope CSV\", \"format\": \"CSV\"}, {\"id\": \"db766d8d-aaee-41bd-82c8-20fd3ac5bbf8\", \"url\": \"https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/generated_png/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.png\", \"name\": \"MTA1.CI.LY_.30.png\", \"description\": \"Preview image\", \"format\": \"PNG\"}, {\"id\": \"9a6cc25f-c6ba-4511-8338-e8d718939de3\", \"url\": \"https://di.ndp.utah.edu/datasets/339c7577-adb1-4f8b-a1c2-a45ef2db142e\", \"name\": \"Contextual Insight Dashboard\", \"description\": \"Dashboard\", \"format\": \"HTML\"}], \"extras\": {\"affinity_dataset_uuid\": \"9571e3cc-309b-44ee-bb71-28b77784d898\", \"affinity_endpoint_uuids\": \"[\\\"66dd11c0-44e2-48a6-bc02-a2c568c3a5a8\\\"]\", \"affinity_service_uuids\": \"[\\\"3a5562fc-4f8f-4d6a-985e-c6965f02129a\\\", \\\"5bbe2d35-bf69-4232-9462-aab3a56f8be1\\\", \\\"710d3ae5-971d-4946-9f1e-14f3ec2adae8\\\"]\", \"affinity_triplet_uuid\": \"13507868-11d6-45e2-b201-f100c7344ab6\", \"contextual_insight_id\": \"339c7577-adb1-4f8b-a1c2-a45ef2db142e\", \"documentation_links\": \"{\\\"EarthScope GNSS Realtime\\\": \\\"https://www.earthscope.org/data/gnss-realtime/\\\", \\\"GAGE/UNAVCO Data Access Methods\\\": \\\"https://www.unavco.org/data/gps-gnss/data-access-methods/data-access-methods.html\\\", \\\"GAGE GPS/GNSS Data Overview\\\": \\\"https://www.unavco.org/data/gps-gnss/gps-gnss.html\\\"}\", \"end_time\": \"2024-12-12T23:59:47Z\", \"spatial\": \"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"Point\\\",\\\"coordina