data: {"type": "message.part.added", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:46:01.970114+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_0d94515cedad", "message_id": "msg_asst_ccd8c7ddaab2", "stream_source": "live", "part": {"id": "live_handoff_45842a982fb0", "type": "expert_handoff", "metadata": {"delegate_to": "ndp_resource_resolver", "agent_id": "ndp_resource_resolver", "question": "Search NDP for and stage the time-series CSV resources for the top-ranked EarthScope GNSS stations within the Los Angeles region. Prioritize the closest stations (MTA1 at 0.3 km, PKRD at 2.2 km, ELSC at 4.1 km, USC2 at 5.0 km, SILK at 5.8 km) to obtain analysis-ready GNSS displacement data (time, east, north, up columns) for recent seismic deformation analysis. Stage at least one station's complete time-series CSV and set acquisition.status=staged with the local_path and analysis_ready=true.", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "data", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "data", "return_payload": "compact_result", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 36984, "execution_mode": "blueprint_react", "input": "Search NDP for and stage the time-series CSV resources for the top-ranked EarthScope GNSS stations within the Los Angeles region. Prioritize the closest stations (MTA1 at 0.3 km, PKRD at 2.2 km, ELSC at 4.1 km, USC2 at 5.0 km, SILK at 5.8 km) to obtain analysis-ready GNSS displacement data (time, east, north, up columns) for recent seismic deformation analysis. Stage at least one station's complete time-series CSV and set acquisition.status=staged with the local_path and analysis_ready=true.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n(To be populated after ndp_resource_resolver stages the station time-series CSV.)\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"acquisition\": {\"analysis_ready\": false, \"metadata_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv\", \"metadata_source_url\": \"https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv\", \"status\": \"metadata_only\"}, \"catalog\": {\"status\": \"metadata_found\"}, \"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"provenance\": \"osm_nominatim\", \"radius_km\": 100, \"region_name\": \"Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\", \"status\": \"resolved\", \"warnings\": [\"Search radius of 100 km assumed as default for regional GNSS and seismic analysis; not specified in request\"]}, \"pipeline\": [\"geospatial\", \"data\", \"analysis\", \"visualization\", \"synthesis\"], \"request\": \"Explore recent seismic activity around Los Angeles with EarthScope GNSS context and artifact\", \"station_catalog\": {\"candidate_count\": 155, \"station_ids\": [\"MTA1\", \"PKRD\", \"ELSC\", \"USC2\", \"SILK\", \"OXYC\", \"P800\", \"LEE2\", \"LEEP\", \"GVRS\", \"BGIS\", \"NOPK\", \"MHMS\", \"VDCY\", \"CIT1\", \"MILK\", \"BRAN\", \"P799\", \"HOLP\", \"LFRS\", \"DYH2\", \"WNRA\", \"BKMS\", \"JPLM\", \"FCTF\", \"UCLP\", \"WRHS\", \"RHCL\", \"WHC1\", \"CSDH\", \"RHCG\", \"LONG\", \"CRHS\", \"WLSN\", \"VIMT\", \"LBC1\", \"LPHS\", \"WMAP\", \"TORP\", \"LBCH\", \"LBC2\", \"HBCO\", \"WCHS\", \"CVHS\", \"PVRS\", \"SNHS\", \"PVHS\", \"AZU1\", \"CGDM\", \"LAPC\", \"CSN1\", \"DAM3\", \"DAM2\", \"BLSA\", \"VNCX\", \"P517\", \"P587\", \"CMP9\", \"CBHS\", \"SPMS\", \"CHIL\", \"SPK1\", \"PVE3\", \"VTIS\", \"PSDM\", \"CCCS\", \"ROCK\", \"LORS\", \"SACY\", \"SKYB\", \"TWMS\", \"CLAR\", \"VNPS\", \"JNHG\", \"