data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:46:35.846799+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_ebebea4b111b462a", "event_type": "expert.response.completed", "session_id": "sess_be7e4295c87a", "workspace_id": "ws_9f03590dd4d4", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_0d94515cedad", "turn_id": "msg_user_0d94515cedad", "span_id": "sem_ebebea4b111b462a", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "Expert data produced a response.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:46:35.838387+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "data"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {"agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": "main"}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"selected_expert": "data", "route_source": "agent_blueprint", "route_reason": "Session selected Agent Blueprint expert 'data'.", "answer": "**EarthScope GNSS Data Acquisition Complete for Los Angeles Seismic Analysis**\n\n**Geographic Resolution:**\n- Region: Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California\n- Center: 34.0536909\u00b0N, 118.242766\u00b0W (OSM Nominatim)\n- Search radius: 100 km\n- Confidence: high\n\n**Station Discovery & Ranking:**\n- EarthScope station catalog: 1,101 total stations\n- Stations within 100 km radius: 155 candidates\n- Top candidate: **MTA1** at 0.3 km (downtown LA area)\n- Alternative candidates ranked by proximity: PKRD (2.2 km), ELSC (4.1 km), USC2 (5.0 km), SILK (5.8 km), and 150 additional stations extending to 99.7 km radius\n\n**Analysis-Ready Data Staged:**\n- **Station**: MTA1 (selected, geographically grounded)\n- **Staged CSV path**: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **File size**: 50.4 MB (50,424,246 bytes)\n- **Content**: GNSS time-series with required columns: time, east, north, up displacement\n- **Temporal coverage**: 2024-12-03 to 2024-12-12 (recent, suitable for earthquake context)\n- **Source URL**: `https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **Format**: text/csv\n- **Status**: Analysis-ready\n\n**Supporting Resources Staged:**\n- **Station metadata catalog**: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`\n- **Catalog source**: EarthScope Stations Dataset via NDP\n- **Catalog metadata URL**: `https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv`\n\n**Data Ready for Downstream Analysis:** The staged MTA1 time-series provides analysis-ready GNSS displacement data for profiling, characterizing seismic deformation patterns, and exploring recent earthquake-related ground motion in the Los Angeles region.", "expert_handoffs": [], "tools_called": [], "file_diffs": [], "error_info": null, "reasoning": "The data acquisition expert has completed the full data pipeline successfully. All three child experts have returned grounded evidence:\n\n1. **ndp_dataset_discovery** (\u2713 completed): Discovered and staged the EarthScope station metadata catalog containing 1,101 GNSS stations at `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`.\n\n2. **earthscope_station_catalog** (\u2713 completed): Spatially filtered the metadata to the Los Angeles 100 km radius region and ranked 155 nearby stations by proximity. MTA1 is the closest candidate at 0.3 km from the LA center (34.0536909\u00b0N, -118.242766\u00b0W).\n\n3. **ndp_resource_resolver** (\u2713 completed): Successfully staged the MTA1 station's time-series CSV (`MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`, 50.4 MB) containing GNSS displacement data (time, east, north, up columns) from 2024-12-03 to 2024-12-12 \u2014 recent data suitable for seismic deformation analysis.\n\n**Completion criteria met:**\n- \u2713 `acquisition.status = \"staged\"`\n- \u2713 `acquisition.analysis_ready = true`\n- \u2713 `acquisition.local_path` = concrete path to staged CSV\n- \u2713 Real station time-series data (not metadata/catalog)\n- \u2713 Required columns present (time, east, north, up)\n\nThe data branch is complete. The staged MTA1 CSV is ready for downstream analysis (profiling, event analysis, visualization)."}}}

