data: {"type": "message.part.added", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:46:35.997790+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_0d94515cedad", "message_id": "msg_asst_ccd8c7ddaab2", "stream_source": "live", "part": {"id": "live_handoff_23dba5097ca1", "type": "expert_handoff", "metadata": {"delegate_to": "data", "agent_id": "data", "question": "Discover EarthScope/NDP GNSS station resources within a 100 km radius of Los Angeles (center: 34.0536909\u00b0N, 118.242766\u00b0W). Rank candidates by spatial relevance and station completeness, then stage a real station time-series CSV (with time, east, north, up columns) suitable for analysis of recent seismic deformation in the region.", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "main", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "main", "return_payload": "compact_result", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 8593, "execution_mode": "blueprint_chain_of_thought", "input": "Discover EarthScope/NDP GNSS station resources within a 100 km radius of Los Angeles (center: 34.0536909\u00b0N, 118.242766\u00b0W). Rank candidates by spatial relevance and station completeness, then stage a real station time-series CSV (with time, east, north, up columns) suitable for analysis of recent seismic deformation in the region.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n(To be populated by synthesis after all downstream experts complete their work.)\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"geospatial\": {\"bbox\": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], \"center_lat\": 34.0536909, \"center_lon\": -118.242766, \"confidence\": \"high\", \"provenance\": \"osm_nominatim\", \"radius_km\": 100, \"region_name\": \"Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States\", \"status\": \"resolved\", \"warnings\": [\"Search radius of 100 km assumed as default for regional GNSS and seismic analysis; not specified in request\"]}, \"pipeline\": [\"geospatial\", \"data\", \"analysis\", \"visualization\", \"synthesis\"], \"request\": \"Explore recent seismic activity around Los Angeles with EarthScope GNSS context and artifact\", \"status\": \"geospatial_complete; routing_to_data\"}}", "output_summary": "**EarthScope GNSS Data Acquisition Complete for Los Angeles Seismic Analysis**\n\n**Geographic Resolution:**\n- Region: Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California\n- Center: 34.0536909\u00b0N, 118.242766\u00b0W (OSM Nominatim)\n- Search radius: 100 km\n- Confidence: high\n\n**Station Discovery & Ranking:**\n- EarthScope station catalog: 1,101 total stations\n- Stations within 100 km radius: 155 candidates\n- Top candidate: **MTA1** at 0.3 km (downtown LA area)\n- Alternative candidates ranked by proximity: PKRD (2.2 km), ELSC (4.1 km), USC2 (5.0 km), SILK (5.8 km), and 150 additional stations extending to 99.7 km radius\n\n**Analysis-Ready Data Staged:**\n- **Station**: MTA1 (selected, geographically grounded)\n- **Staged CSV path**: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **File size**: 50.4 MB (50,424,246 bytes)\n- **Content**: GNSS time-series with required columns: time, east, north, up displacement\n- **Temporal coverage**: 2024-12-03 to 2024-12-12 (recent, suitable for earthquake context)\n- **Source URL**: `https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **Format**: text/csv\n- **Status**: Analysis-ready\n\n**Supporting Resources Staged:**\n- **Station metadata catalog**: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`\n- **Catalog source**: EarthScope Stations Dataset via NDP\n- **Catalog metadata URL**: `https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv`\n\n**Data Ready for Downstream Analysis:** The staged MTA1 time-series provides analysis-ready GNSS displacement data for profiling, characterizing seismic deformation patterns, and exploring recent earthquake-related ground motion in the Los Angeles region.", "return_output_summary": "**EarthScope GNSS Data Acquisition Complete for Los Angeles Seismic Analysis**\n\n**Geographic Resolution:**\n- Region: Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California\n- Center: 34.0536909\u00b0N, 118.242766\u00b0W (OSM Nominatim)\n- Search radius: 100 km\n- Confidence: high\n\n**Station Discovery & Ranking:**\n- EarthScope station catalog: 1,101 total stations\n- Stations within 100 km radius: 155 candidates\n- Top candidate: **MTA1** at 0.3 km (downtown LA area)\n- Alternative candidates ranked by proximity: PKRD (2.2 km), ELSC (4.1 km), USC2 (5.0 km), SILK (5.8 km), and 150 additional stations extending to 99.7 km radius\n\n**Analysis-Ready Data Staged:**\n- **Station**: MTA1 (selected, geographically grounded)\n- **Staged CSV path**: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **File size**: 50.4 MB (50,424,246 bytes)\n- **Content**: GNSS time-series with required columns: time, east, north, up displacement\n- **Temporal coverage**: 2024-12-03 to 2024-12-12 (recent, suitable for earthquake context)\n- **Source URL**: `https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv`\n- **Format**: text/csv\n- **Status**: Analysis-ready\n\n**Supporting Resources Staged:**\n- **Station metadata catalog**: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv`\n- **Catalog source**: EarthScope Stations Dataset via NDP\n- **Catalog metadata URL**: `https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv`\n\n**Data Ready for Downstream Analysis:** The staged MTA1 time-series provides analysis-ready GNSS displacement data for profiling, characterizing seismic deformation patterns, and exploring recent earthquake-related ground motion in the Los Angeles region.", "local_output_summary": "(To be populated after all data-branch children complete their work and evidence is merged.)", "workflow_state": {"geospatial": {"bbox": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], "center_lat": 34.0536909, "center_lon": -118.242766, "confidence": "high", "provenance": "osm_nominatim", "radius_km": 100, "region_name": "Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States", "status": "resolved", "warnings": ["Search radius of 100 km assumed as default for regional GNSS and seismic analysis; not specified in request"]}, "pipeline": ["geospatial", "data", "analysis", "visualization", "synthesis"], "request": "Explore recent seismic activity around Los Angeles with EarthScope GNSS context and artifact", "status": "data_station_ranking_pending", "catalog": {"status": "metadata_found"}, "acquisition": {"status": "staged", "metadata_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "analysis_ready": true, "local_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "source_url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "size_bytes": 50424246}, "station_catalog": {"status": "ranked", "candidate_count": 155, "station_ids": ["MTA1", "PKRD", "ELSC", "USC2", "SIL