ata \u2192 analysis \u2192 visualization \u2192 synthesis) is needed to satisfy the user's request. The staged MTA1 CSV triggers continuation to `analysis`, which will profile the data and assess station suitability for seismic deformation analysis. Then `visualization` will create a PNG artifact. Finally, `synthesis` will write the user-facing answer.\n\n**Next step:** Route to `analysis` to profile the staged MTA1 time-series data and assess its suitability for seismic deformation analysis."}}}

