00 of 250,000 rows profiled (scan-limited)\n- Time/cadence/duration/gap quality for full file not verified\n- Missing-value status for full file not verified\n\nThe profiling is complete and confirms required columns, data types, and sample-row statistics. I will now finish and forward this evidence to the parent analysis expert.", "reasoning": "", "tool_name": "finish", "tool_args": {}, "observation": "Completed.", "is_finish": true}}}

