id: 182
data: {"type": "message.part.delta", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:48:08.137468+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_0d94515cedad", "message_id": "msg_asst_ccd8c7ddaab2", "part_id": "part_9808420e74b4", "stream_source": "live", "delta": {"text_append": "**MTA1 GNSS Time-Series Profile Summary**\n\n**Station:** MTA1 (downtown Los Angeles, 0.3 km from region center)\n\n**File:** MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv (50.4 MB, 250,000 rows)\n\n**Required Columns:** All present \u2713\n- time (integer, milliseconds since epoch)\n- east, north, up (float, meters)\n- sigEE, sigNN, sigUU (float, meters \u2014 uncertainty estimates)\n- qChannel (integer, quality flag)\n\n**Profiled Data (5,000 of 250,000 rows):**\n\n*Displacement Ranges:*\n- East: \u22120.07 to \u22120.03 m (mean \u22120.047 m)\n- North: 0.029 to 0.058 m (mean 0.045 m)\n- Up: 0.051 to 0.224 m (mean 0.136 m)\n\n*Uncertainty Ranges:*\n- sigEE: 0.032\u20130.035 m (mean 0.033 m)\n- sigNN: 0.032\u20130.036 m (mean 0.033 m)\n- sigUU: 0.062\u20130.066 m (mean 0.065 m)\n\n*Null Values in Profiled Rows:* Zero across all columns\n\n*Sample Temporal Spacing:* Adjacent rows suggest 1-second local cadence (1733184000000 ms \u2192 1733184001000 ms \u2192 1733184002000 ms)\n\n**Profiling Limitations:**\n- Scan-limited profile: only 5,000 of 250,000 rows used for numeric statistics\n- Time range min/max reflects profiled rows only (~1.4-hour span), not the full file\n- Full-file cadence, duration (2024-12-03 to 2024-12-12), gap analysis, and completeness not verified\n- Missing-value status for full file not verified\n- qChannel values (min 1,314,021, max 2,411,021, mean 1,847,152) are opaque flag integers without decoding\n\n**Status:** Analysis-ready for downstream processing with awareness of profiling scope limitations.\n\n"}}}

