\": \"0.036\", \"sigUU\": \"0.063\", \"qChannel\": \"1414021\"}, {\"time\": \"1733184001000\", \"east\": \"-0.049\", \"north\": \"0.054\", \"up\": \"0.217\", \"sigEE\": \"0.033\", \"sigNN\": \"0.036\", \"sigUU\": \"0.063\", \"qChannel\": \"1414021\"}, {\"time\": \"1733184002000\", \"east\": \"-0.05\", \"north\": \"0.054\", \"up\": \"0.217\", \"sigEE\": \"0.033\", \"sigNN\": \"0.036\", \"sigUU\": \"0.063\", \"qChannel\": \"1414021\"}], \"message\": \"Profiled 8 columns across 5000 of 250000 scanned rows\"}", "thought_1": "The profiler has successfully analyzed the MTA1 GNSS time-series CSV. Key results:\n\n**Data structure validated:**\n- 8 columns present: time, east, north, up, sigEE, sigNN, sigUU, qChannel \u2713\n- All required displacement columns present \u2713\n- 250,000 total rows; 5,000 profiled for statistics (scan-limited)\n- 50.4 MB file size \u2713\n- Zero null values in profiled rows \u2713\n\n**Temporal coverage (profiled rows only):**\n- Time range: 1733184000000 to 1733189070000 (1.4-hour span in profiled sample)\n- Sample rows show 1-second local spacing (1733184000000 \u2192 1733184001000 \u2192 1733184002000)\n- Full temporal span (2024-12-03 to 2024-12-12) not verified by profile; only profiled rows span ~1.4 hours\n\n**Displacement ranges (profiled rows):**\n- East: -0.07 to -0.03 m (mean -0.047 m)\n- North: 0.029 to 0.058 m (mean 0.045 m)\n- Up: 0.051 to 0.224 m (mean 0.136 m)\n\n**Uncertainties (profiled rows):**\n- sigEE: 0.032\u20130.035 m (mean 0.033 m)\n- sigNN: 0.032\u20130.036 m (mean 0.033 m)\n- sigUU: 0.062\u20130.066 m (mean 0.065 m)\n\n**Profiling limitations:**\n- Only 5,000 of 250,000 rows profiled (scan-limited)\n- Time/cadence/duration/gap quality for full file not verified\n- Missing-value status for full file not verified\n\nThe profiling is complete and confirms required columns, data types, and sample-row statistics. I will now finish and forward this evidence to the parent analysis expert.", "tool_name_1": "finish", "tool_args_1": {}, "observation_1": "Completed."}, "reasoning": "The GNSS time-series profiler successfully analyzed the staged MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv file from the NDP EarthScope collection. The profile confirms:\n\n1. **Data Structure:** All 8 required columns present (time, east, north, up, sigEE, sigNN, sigUU, qChannel) with correct dtypes (integer for time/qChannel, float for displacements and uncertainties).\n\n2. **File Coverage:** The profiler scanned 250,000 total rows and computed statistics on 5,000 rows (scan-limited to default). The file size is 50.4 MB, consistent with the staged resource metadata.\n\n3. **Null Counts:** Zero null values across all columns in the profiled 5,000 rows.\n\n4. **Displacement Ranges (profiled rows):** \n   - East: \u22120.07 to \u22120.03 m (mean \u22120.047 m, westward)\n   - North: 0.029 to 0.058 m (mean 0.045 m, northward)\n   - Up: 0.051 to 0.224 m (mean 0.136 m, upward)\n\n5. **Uncertainty Ranges (profiled rows):**\n   - sigEE (east): 0.032\u20130.035 m (mean 0.033 m)\n   - sigNN (north): 0.032\u20130.036 m (mean 0.033 m)\n   - sigUU (up): 0.062\u20130.066 m (mean 0.065 m)\n\n6. **Sample Temporal Spacing:** Adjacent sample rows (1733184000000, 1733184001000, 1733184002000) suggest local 1-second spacing in the visible sample; full-file cadence not verified.\n\n**Profiling Scope:** Only 5,000 of 250,000 rows were profiled for numeric summaries. Time min/max statistics span only the profiled rows. Full-file temporal coverage, cadence, duration, gap analysis, and completeness were not verified. Missing-value status for the full file was not verified."}}}

