 m (mean 0.065 m)\n\n*Null Values in Profiled Rows:* Zero across all columns\n\n*Sample Temporal Spacing:* Adjacent rows suggest 1-second local cadence (1733184000000 ms \u2192 1733184001000 ms \u2192 1733184002000 ms)\n\n**Profiling Limitations:**\n- Scan-limited profile: only 5,000 of 250,000 rows used for numeric statistics\n- Time range min/max reflects profiled rows only (~1.4-hour span), not the full file\n- Full-file cadence, duration (2024-12-03 to 2024-12-12), gap analysis, and completeness not verified\n- Missing-value status for full file not verified\n- qChannel values (min 1,314,021, max 2,411,021, mean 1,847,152) are opaque flag integers without decoding\n\n**Status:** Analysis-ready for downstream processing with awareness of profiling scope limitations.", "return_output_summary": "**MTA1 GNSS Time-Series Profile Summary**\n\n**Station:** MTA1 (downtown Los Angeles, 0.3 km from region center)\n\n**File:** MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv (50.4 MB, 250,000 rows)\n\n**Required Columns:** All present \u2713\n- time (integer, milliseconds since epoch)\n- east, north, up (float, meters)\n- sigEE, sigNN, sigUU (float, meters \u2014 uncertainty estimates)\n- qChannel (integer, quality flag)\n\n**Profiled Data (5,000 of 250,000 rows):**\n\n*Displacement Ranges:*\n- East: \u22120.07 to \u22120.03 m (mean \u22120.047 m)\n- North: 0.029 to 0.058 m (mean 0.045 m)\n- Up: 0.051 to 0.224 m (mean 0.136 m)\n\n*Uncertainty Ranges:*\n- sigEE: 0.032\u20130.035 m (mean 0.033 m)\n- sigNN: 0.032\u20130.036 m (mean 0.033 m)\n- sigUU: 0.062\u20130.066 m (mean 0.065 m)\n\n*Null Values in Profiled Rows:* Zero across all columns\n\n*Sample Temporal Spacing:* Adjacent rows suggest 1-second local cadence (1733184000000 ms \u2192 1733184001000 ms \u2192 1733184002000 ms)\n\n**Profiling Limitations:**\n- Scan-limited profile: only 5,000 of 250,000 rows used for numeric statistics\n- Time range min/max reflects profiled rows only (~1.4-hour span), not the full file\n- Full-file cadence, duration (2024-12-03 to 2024-12-12), gap analysis, and completeness not verified\n- Missing-value status for full file not verified\n- qChannel values (min 1,314,021, max 2,411,021, mean 1,847,152) are opaque flag integers without decoding\n\n**Status:** Analysis-ready for downstream processing with awareness of profiling scope limitations.", "workflow_state": {"acquisition": {"analysis_ready": true, "local_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "metadata_path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/earthscope_stations_clean.csv", "metadata_source_url": "https://nationaldataplatform.org/catalog/dataset/811f0bcc-99e5-455c-bcf6-7c63c2634f41/resource/a420cc30-2262-423a-8c63-3ad8d91f2a8f/download/earthscope_converted_data.csv", "size_bytes": 50424246, "source_url": "https://ds2.datacollaboratory.org/Earthscope_api_dec2024/raw_csv/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv", "status": "staged"}, "catalog": {"status": "metadata_found"}, "geospatial": {"bbox": [-118.6681798, 33.659541, -118.1552983, 34.337306], "center_lat": 34.0536909, "center_lon": -118.242766, "confidence": "high", "provenance": "osm_nominatim", "radius_km": 100, "region_name": "Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States", "status": "resolved", "warnings": ["Search radius of 100 km assumed as default for regional GNSS and seismic analysis; not specified in request"]}, "pipeline": ["geospatial", "data", "analysis", "visualization", "synthesis"], "request": "Explore recent seismic activity around Los Angeles with EarthScope GNSS context and artifact", "resource_candidate": {"geographically_grounded": true, "station_id": "MTA1", "status": "selected"}, "station_catalog": {"candidate_count": 155, "status": "ranked"}, "status": "analysis_profiling_in_progress", "profile": {"status": "complete", "path": "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1