id: 233
data: {"type": "message.part.completed", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:50:20.223503+00:00", "payload": {"turn_id": "msg_user_0d94515cedad", "message_id": "msg_asst_ccd8c7ddaab2", "part_id": "part_59a8d5edcef2", "stream_source": "live", "final_text": "**EarthScope GNSS Analysis Summary: MTA1 Station Context for Los Angeles Seismic Deformation**\n\n**Data Acquisition & Profile:**\nThe MTA1 station time-series (MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv, 50.4 MB, 250,000 rows) contains all required GNSS displacement columns: time, east, north, up displacements, and corresponding uncertainties (sigEE, sigNN, sigUU). The profiled sample (5,000 rows) shows centimeter-scale measurement uncertainties and zero null values, with displacement ranges from \u22120.07 to +0.22 m across components. The profile is scan-limited; full-file cadence, duration, and gap quality were not verified.\n\n**Station Suitability:**\nMTA1 is geographically optimal for Los Angeles seismic deformation monitoring, positioned at the city center (0.3 km from region center, 34.0536909\u00b0N, 118.242766\u00b0W). The station is the closest candidate within a dense 155-station EarthScope network spanning 100 km radius. Displacement uncertainties (3.2\u20133.6 cm horizontal, 6.2\u20136.6 cm vertical) are centimeter-scale, appropriate for regional deformation analysis. Alternative nearby stations (PKRD at 2.2 km, ELSC at 4.1 km, USC2 at 5.0 km) are available for multi-station validation.\n\n**Event Context Limitation:**\nThis analysis pack lacks a live earthquake catalog tool (USGS Earthquake Hazards Program API or equivalent). Seismic event context (magnitudes, depths, epicenters, timing) for the 2024-12-03 to 2024-12-12 window cannot be retrieved. The GNSS displacement time-series is staged and analyzed, but earthquake event attribution remains unavailable without external catalog integration.\n\n**Analysis Scope & Caveats:**\n- Profile is scan-limited to 5,000 of 250,000 rows for numeric statistics\n- Full-file temporal cadence, duration, gap analysis, and completeness not verified\n- qChannel quality flag values are opaque without decoding\n- Metadata timestamp range (2024-12-03 to 2024-12-12) from resource metadata, not tool-verified\n- Suitability assessment is preliminary pending full-file verification\n\n"}}

