sing-value status not assessed\n- Plot demonstrates displacement ranges (east: \u22120.07 to \u22120.03 m; north: 0.029\u20130.058 m; up: 0.051\u20130.224 m)\n\n**Caveats**:\n- Visualization uses 2000 of 250,000 available rows\n- Time-series plot shows selected displacement components only\n- Full-file temporal continuity, measurement cadence, and gap quality not verified from plot\n- Artifact suitable for regional seismic deformation discussion and context presentation", "return_output_summary": "**PNG Time-Series Artifact Successfully Generated**\n\n**Artifact Path**: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1_timeseries_displacement.png`\n\n**Plot Specification**:\n- **Station**: MTA1 (downtown Los Angeles, 0.3 km from region center)\n- **Displacement Components**: East, North, Up (all three plotted on shared time axis)\n- **Temporal Axis**: time (epoch milliseconds, UTC)\n- **Data Points**: 2000 rows plotted (from 250,000-row CSV)\n- **Title**: \"MTA1 GNSS Displacement Time Series (East, North, Up) - Los Angeles Region\"\n\n**Data Coverage**:\n- Profiled sample represents the first portion of the time-series\n- Full-file cadence, duration, and gap analysis not verified from visualization sample\n- Zero null values in profiled rows; full-file missing-value status not assessed\n- Plot demonstrates displacement ranges (east: \u22120.07 to \u22120.03 m; north: 0.029\u20130.058 m; up: 0.051\u20130.224 m)\n\n**Caveats**:\n- Visualization uses 2000 of 250,000 available rows\n- Time-series plot shows selected displacement components only\n- Full-file temporal continuity, measurement cadence, and gap quality not verified from plot\n- Artifact suitable for regional seismic deformation discussion and context presentation", "local_output_summary": "**PNG Time-Series Artifact Successfully Generated**\n\n**Artifact Path**: `/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1_timese