data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:51:38.556708+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_2380d56ff2fb4c08", "event_type": "expert.response.completed", "session_id": "sess_be7e4295c87a", "workspace_id": "ws_9f03590dd4d4", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_0d94515cedad", "turn_id": "msg_user_0d94515cedad", "span_id": "sem_2380d56ff2fb4c08", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "Expert main produced a response.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:51:38.544746+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "main"}, "subject": {}, "blueprint": {"agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": ""}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"selected_expert": "main", "route_source": "agent_blueprint", "route_reason": "Session selected Agent Blueprint expert 'main'.", "answer": "(To be written by synthesis expert, combining geospatial, acquisition, analysis, and artifact evidence with appropriate caveats.)", "expert_handoffs": [], "tools_called": [], "file_diffs": [], "error_info": null, "reasoning": "The main orchestrator has successfully executed the full pipeline:\n\n1. **Geospatial** (\u2713 complete): Resolved Los Angeles place name to precise coordinates (34.0536909\u00b0N, 118.242766\u00b0W) with 100 km search radius via OSM Nominatim geocoding.\n\n2. **Data** (\u2713 complete): Discovered 155 EarthScope GNSS stations in the LA region, ranked by proximity, and staged the optimal MTA1 station (0.3 km from center) with a real time-series CSV containing 250,000 rows of GNSS displacement data (time, east, north, up columns).\n\n3. **Analysis** (\u2713 complete): Profiled the staged MTA1 CSV, confirmed all required columns present, assessed station as geographically optimal for LA seismic deformation monitoring with centimeter-scale measurement uncertainties, and identified the event-context capability gap (no live USGS earthquake catalog tool available).\n\n4. **Visualization** (\u2713 complete): Successfully created a PNG time-series artifact showing east, north, and up displacement components from 2000 plotted rows, saved to the workspace with full title and legend.\n\n**Workflow Status**: All pipeline stages complete. The user's request asked to \"explore recent seismic activity\" with \"EarthScope or earthquake catalog evidence\" and \"produce an artifact.\" The workflow has delivered:\n- \u2713 Geographic resolution (Los Angeles)\n- \u2713 EarthScope GNSS evidence (MTA1 station staged, profiled, visualized)\n- \u2717 Earthquake catalog evidence (blocked by missing tool, but this is an honest limitation, not a failure)\n- \u2713 Artifact (PNG time-series plot ready)\n\n**Next step**: Route to `synthesis` to merge all grounded evidence into a final user-facing answer with proper provenance, artifact paths, and documented limitations."}}}

