data: {"type": "semantic.event", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:52:01.751198+00:00", "payload": {"schema_version": "clio.semantic_event.v1", "event_id": "sem_a1ae68a6e4a8473e", "event_type": "blueprint.delegation.completed", "session_id": "sess_be7e4295c87a", "workspace_id": "ws_9f03590dd4d4", "trace_id": "trace_msg_user_0d94515cedad", "turn_id": "msg_user_0d94515cedad", "span_id": "sem_a1ae68a6e4a8473e", "parent_span_id": "", "status": "completed", "summary": "synthesis returned a compact result to main.", "live_observed": true, "detail_level": "semantic", "occurred_at": "2026-06-25T22:52:01.736476+00:00", "actor": {"agent_id": "synthesis", "role": "child_expert"}, "subject": {"agent_id": "main", "role": "parent_expert"}, "blueprint": {"pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "agent_blueprint_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "parent_expert": "main", "child_expert": "synthesis"}, "provider": {"provider_id": "", "model_id": ""}, "payload": {"delegate_to": "synthesis", "agent_id": "synthesis", "question": "Write the final user-facing answer for the Los Angeles seismic activity exploration request. Synthesize all grounded evidence: (1) geographic resolution (Los Angeles via OSM Nominatim, 34.0536909\u00b0N, 118.242766\u00b0W, 100 km radius); (2) EarthScope GNSS discovery (155 nearby stations, MTA1 closest at 0.3 km, staged time-series CSV with 250,000 rows of displacement data); (3) analysis results (MTA1 station suitability assessment, centimeter-scale uncertainties, scan-limited profile, full-file cadence/gaps not verified); (4) PNG time-series artifact (path: MTA1_timeseries_displacement.png, showing east/north/up displacement components over 2000 plotted rows); (5) event context limitation (no live USGS earthquake catalog tool available in this pack, so seismic event attribution is unavailable). Present the artifact as suitable for discussing seismic deformation patterns. Include all caveats about scan-limited profile, unverified full-file quality, and missing earthquake context.", "status": "completed", "execute": true, "source": "agent_next_expert", "parent_id": "main", "pack_id": "earthscope-gnss-region", "pack_version": "0.1.0", "provider_id": "", "model_id": "", "fallback_warnings": [], "stage": "delegate.completed", "delegation_lifecycle": "sync", "return_to": "main", "return_payload": "compact_result", "depth": 0, "duration_ms": 22839, "execution_mode": "blueprint_chain_of_thought", "input": "Write the final user-facing answer for the Los Angeles seismic activity exploration request. Synthesize all grounded evidence: (1) geographic resolution (Los Angeles via OSM Nominatim, 34.0536909\u00b0N, 118.242766\u00b0W, 100 km radius); (2) EarthScope GNSS discovery (155 nearby stations, MTA1 closest at 0.3 km, staged time-series CSV with 250,000 rows of displacement data); (3) analysis results (MTA1 station suitability assessment, centimeter-scale uncertainties, scan-limited profile, full-file cadence/gaps not verified); (4) PNG time-series artifact (path: MTA1_timeseries_displacement.png, showing east/north/up displacement components over 2000 plotted rows); (5) event context limitation (no live USGS earthquake catalog tool available in this pack, so seismic event attribution is unavailable). Present the artifact as suitable for discussing seismic deformation patterns. Include all caveats about scan-limited profile, unverified full-file quality, and missing earthquake context.\n\nParent evidence available for this delegated task:\n\n(To be written by synthesis expert, combining geospatial, acquisition, analysis, and artifact evidence with appropriate caveats.)\n\nAccumulated typed workflow state from prior CLIO tool evidence (authoritative; use this before local prose summaries):\n{\"workflow_state\": {\"acquisition\": {\"analysis_ready\": true, \"local_path\": \"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-jcernuda/bb1bd9e8-d4b5-42a4-b525-af9e6ee77aaa/scratchpad/la_run/ws/MTA1.CI.LY_.30.csv\", \"metadata_path\": \"/tmp/claude-100